<title>UK: N Ireland Elec up on Warburg price advice.</title>
<headline>N Ireland Elec up on Warburg price advice.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Northern Ireland Electricity Plc put on 11p to 391p in meagre trading volume, after SBC Warburg analyst Nick Pink raised his price target to 400p from 380p, dealers said.</p>
<p>Pink's recommendation on the stock is unchanged at &quot;add&quot;. He was unwilling to make any further comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
